for personal noncommercial use, noncommercial teaching and noncommercial
research. Direct or indirect commercial purposes are prohibited, including
internal business operations, work for an employer, paid individual work,
paid teaching/services, sales or paid distribution, commercial product
integration, and advertising-funded or paid services. Free end-user access
does not make a commercial service noncommercial. Educational/research labels
do not exempt commercial projects. Commercial use requires separate permission
from all relevant rights holders.

3. Distribution. Include this license, copyright and applicable branding and
third-party notices. License modified/derivative versions under these same
terms, preserving the noncommercial condition and recipients' granted rights.
Independent nonderivative components retain their own terms. Distribute the
complete corresponding source with any executable, or provide equivalent,
free access alongside it for as long as the executable is offered. Source
includes changes, build scripts, necessary configuration and dependency
instructions sufficient to build that version, but excludes the OS, general
runtime libraries, unrelated private data and API credentials. Clearly mark
